# dated_guard.rish — doorway for Tier 1 + freeze-class dated staged mods (e237).
# Missing Rishi verb (this wrapper's body): accumulate · filter chained · read bounded — counsel 20260725.040247
#
# A doorway, not an auditor (e236): inspects staged MODIFIED paths only.
# Tier 1 proof-sealed paths always refuse. Freeze-class dated paths
# (witness · golden · receipt · keys/) on main need living ledger, freeze
# pointer, or Radiant pass. Amendable-roof dated seats are OK until superseded.
# Vacuous GREEN when the index has no freeze/Tier-1 staged mods.
#
# Spec: context/specs/living-vs-dated.md
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/dated_guard.rish

say "dated-guard: scanning staged MODIFIED freeze/Tier-1 paths…"

let scan = run ["rishi/bin/rishi" "run" "tools/fixtures/dated_guard_scan.rish"]
say scan.out
assert scan.ok else "dated-guard RED: staged freeze-class or Tier 1 path refused"
say "GREEN: dated-guard — freeze/Tier-1 staged mods declare living or are absent."
